# Upstream checksums for the jekyll-theme-chirpy files this repo vendors.
#
# Each entry is the sha256 of the THEME GEM's copy of a file that we override
# under _includes/ or _layouts/, recorded at the theme version named below.
# Our local copies are deliberate forks of these, so they can't be compared for
# equality -- instead we watch upstream. When the gem's copy changes, our fork
# is stale and needs re-reviewing against the new upstream.
#
# Regenerate after intentionally re-syncing a fork:
#   bash tools/check-theme-sync.sh --update
#
# theme-version: 7.6.0
11161121255196631b9323aa8474e9dca8f81c7d54247cb0d5b99bc3d12625f7  _includes/sidebar.html
e86914a1fa7c81435a08e1d9c293672c2a288784cb4386a9bc4c187c56dd11d4  _includes/topbar.html
ccc9fa8ff570a9256ce271550b96c6b92d94d1c254d0b2a16e097e08aa1c5eb7  _includes/refactor-content.html
766995a87d44f878b8ca541b4768ae713e3ce1afdc2a006cebe1edcd816384eb  _layouts/home.html
1fb016f23173c41745146a2da460301f44ca49ebbb56aa75b01135c4d2462203  _layouts/post.html
